{{!
    @template local_cleanup/summary

    The figures above a clean-up report.

    Every value is printed with double braces rather than triple, so it is escaped. The rows
    carry counts and sizes, but the note can carry a date, and none of it is markup.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * items - array of objects with label and value, in display order
    * hasnote - whether there is a line to show underneath the figures
    * note - that line

    Example context (json):
    {
        "items": [
            {"label": "Files found", "value": "2,462"},
            {"label": "Total size", "value": "1.4 GB"}
        ],
        "hasnote": true,
        "note": "Next clean-up: 1 September 2026, 3:00 AM"
    }
}}
<div class="card mb-3 local-cleanup-summary">
    <div class="card-body">
        <dl class="row mb-0">
            {{#items}}
                <dt class="col-sm-4">{{label}}</dt>
                <dd class="col-sm-8">{{value}}</dd>
            {{/items}}
        </dl>
        {{#hasnote}}
            <p class="text-muted mb-0 mt-2">{{note}}</p>
        {{/hasnote}}
    </div>
</div>
